{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"catalogs/runtime/scenes/20d8fcb1654b35b860ed.json":{"assets":{"mn2/gameplay_story_10612020":{"skip":{"source_cn":"村民费莉希的鸭子们跑出了围栏，但她要照顾家人，无法离开，所以请你帮她找回鸭子。","text_i18n":{"cn":"村民费莉希的鸭子们跑出了围栏，但她要照顾家人，无法离开，所以请你帮她找回鸭子。","en":"Felicity accidentally left her fence gate open, causing her ducks to escape. She can't search for them herself, so she asks for your help in finding them.","jp":"村人のフェリスのアヒルたちが柵から逃げてしまったが、彼女は家族の面倒を見なければならず、離れられない。そこで、あなたにアヒルたちを連れ戻すよう依頼した。","kr":"마을 주민 펠리시의 오리가 울타리 밖으로 도망갔다. 가족을 돌보느라 자리를 비울 수 없는 그녀가 오리를 찾아달라고 부탁했다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["10612020"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["22567"]}}}},"catalogs/runtime/scenes/5fa87d9ccca732b11a8d.json":{"assets":{"mn2/gameplay_story_10612030":{"skip":{"source_cn":"鸭子们全都找回来了，费莉希拿出了准备好的礼物来感谢你。","text_i18n":{"cn":"鸭子们全都找回来了，费莉希拿出了准备好的礼物来感谢你。","en":"All the ducks have been found. Felicity prepares a gift to thank you.","jp":"アヒルたちはすべて家に帰した。フェリスは準備してあったプレゼントを取り出して、あなたに感謝した。","kr":"오리를 모두 되찾아오자, 펠리시가 감사의 뜻으로 준비한 선물을 주었다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["10612030"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["22568"]}}}},"locales/cn/mn2/gameplay_story/10612010.json":{"asset_key":"mn2/gameplay_story_10612010","episode":"mn2","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10612010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1061201001:0":{"text":"呜呜，这可怎么办……","source_cn":"呜呜，这可怎么办……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11A7B764CA0EB94E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民费莉希":{"text":"村民费莉希","source":"村民费莉希","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/cn/mn2/gameplay_story/10612020.json":{"asset_key":"mn2/gameplay_story_10612020","episode":"mn2","category":"gameplay